==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*12 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the Normal Cats to win.

==Trivia==
*Daidai Domain is named after the Japanese word 橙 ''daidai'' (orange).

